WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.624
This is ASTRA AI OS, presented through its actual JARVIS interface.

00:00:04.624 --> 00:00:07.799
The home screen connects to one local runtime.

00:00:07.799 --> 00:00:16.220
Provider selection lives behind explicit policy, while agent work is represented by durable plans, steps, and checkpoints.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:22.155
Tool permission is a separate boundary: a model decision does not authorize an action.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:28.298
These captures use a fresh isolated runtime with no private notes or live provider calls.

00:00:28.298 --> 00:00:35.062
Seven original contract checks passed; live integrations still require their own acceptance tests.
